title: Salem4
---
This time when you visited the cafe, Salem was sitting in that same
corner she liked, her lunch laid out with small, sweet snacks.

She looked up at you, more rested, smiling brightly and gesturing
to the seat in front of her.

Salem: "{$playerName}!"
Salem: "You always come at the same time, that's good,"

You watched her hands as they reached into your bag.

You: "Why's that?"

Your answer came when she pulled out a premade lunch and pushed
it toward you.

She smiled bashfully, playing with her hair as you opened it.

The food was fresh and smelled amazing. Your mouth watered.

Salem: "I... made this for you,"

Her voice rose into a soft squeak.

You smiled and took a fork, digging in.

Salem: "So, how was your day?"
-> Realist view
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump RealistView>>
-> Optimistic view
    <<jump OptimistView>>
-> Pessimistic View
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump PessimistView>>
===

title: RealistView
---
You: "Well..."
You: "I've been stressed about the essay and how to write it."
You: "Once I get through the brunt of it, I'll be fine."

<<jump EndSalem4>>
===

title: OptimistView
---
You: "Actually everything is going well!"
You: "I've been doing good today."

<<jump EndSalem4>>
===

title: PessimistView
---
You: "It's been tough."
You: "Honestly I'm pretty stressed, but I'll figure it out."

<<jump EndSalem4>>
===

title: EndSalem4
---
Salem nodded as you spoke, then her eyes widened.

Salem: "Oh! I almost forgot,"

She dug into her bag and pulled out her notebook.

She ripped out a page and handed it to you.

Salem: "My answer, like always,"

You took it and looked back at her.

She watched you with a dreamy expression, waiting.

'Okay then,' you thought before reading.
===